Since $\pi \approx 3.14159$, $3.28318 - \pi \approx 3.28318 - 3.14159 = 0.14159$, so $\sin^{-1}(\sin 3) \approx \sin^{-1}(\sin(0.14159)) \approx 0.14159$.
