Finally, for $x=5$, $5 > \frac{3\pi}{2}$, so $\sin^{-1}(\sin 5) = \sin^{-1}(\sin(\pi - 5)) = \sin^{-1}(\sin(5 - 2\pi)) = |5 - 2\pi| = |5 - 6.28318| = | -1.28318 | = 1.28318$.
